OB_EDATA1_active|Activate Bank1 EDATA|Flash data sectors||||
EDATA1size|Size|Flash data sectors||0|8|<font color="green">Bit 2:0</font> <b> EDATA1_STRT[2:0]:</b> EDATA1_STRT contains the start sectors of the Flash high-cycle data area in Bank 1. There is no hardware effect to those bits. They shall be managed by ST tools in Flasher. 0:000: The last sector of the Bank 1 is reserved for Flash high-cycle data 1:001: The two last sectors of the Bank 1 are reserved for Flash high-cycle data 2:010: The three last sectors of the Bank 1 are reserved for Flash high-cycle data ... 7:111: The eight last sectors of the Bank 1 are reserved for Flash high-cycle data Note: Bit 2 is reserved on 512-Kbyte product configuration
OB_EDATA_BOTHBANKS|same EDATA1 and EDATA2 for both banks|Write sector group Protection||||
OB_EDATA2_active|Activate Bank2 EDATA|Flash data sectors||||
EDATA2size|Size|Flash data sectors||0|8|<font color="green">Bit 2:0</font> <b> EDATA2_STRT[2:0]:</b> EDATA1_STRT contains the start sectors of the Flash high-cycle data area in Bank 1. There is no hardware effect to those bits. They shall be managed by ST tools in Flasher. 0:000: The last sector of the Bank 1 is reserved for Flash high-cycle data 1:001: The two last sectors of the Bank 1 are reserved for Flash high-cycle data 2:010: The three last sectors of the Bank 1 are reserved for Flash high-cycle data ... 7:111: The eight last sectors of the Bank 1 are reserved for Flash high-cycle data Note: Bit 2 is reserved on 512-Kbyte product configuration
OB_HDP1_active|Activate Bank1 HDP|Flash HDP||||
HDP1start|Start sector|Flash HDP||0|=numberOfSectors-1|<font color="green">Bit 6:0</font> <b> HDP1_STRT[6:0]:</b> HDPL barrier start set in number of 8-Kbyte sectors in bank1. Must not be set to overlap with Flash high-cycle data area.
HDP1end|End sector|Flash HDP||0|=numberOfSectors-1|<font color="green">Bit 22:16</font> <b> HDP1_END[6:0]:</b>HDPL barrier end set in number of 8-Kbyte sectors in Bank 1. Must not be set to overlap with Flash high-cycle data area.
OB_HDP_BOTHBANKS|same HDP1 and HDP2 for both banks|Write sector group Protection||||
OB_HDP2_active|Activate Bank2 HDP|Flash HDP||||
HDP2start|Start sector|Flash HDP||0|=numberOfSectors-1|<font color="green">Bit 6:0</font> <b> HDP1_STRT[6:0]:</b> HDPL barrier start set in number of 8-Kbyte sectors in bank 2. Must not be set to overlap with Flash high-cycle data area.
HDP2end|End sector|Flash HDP||0|=numberOfSectors-1|<font color="green">Bit 22:16</font> <b> HDP1_END[6:0]:</b>HDPL barrier end set in number of 8-Kbyte sectors in Bank 2. Must not be set to overlap with Flash high-cycle data area.
